Package: osm-tilegen
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: osm-tilegen <root@localhost>
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-fastapi, python3-uvicorn, python3-pil,
 osmium-tool, tilemaker, adduser
Recommends: xvfb
Description: Offline OSM raster tile generator with a web UI
 Upload .osm.pbf files, preview them in several map styles, select an area
 on the XYZ tile grid and render PNG/JPG tiles (z/x/y) for offline maps on
 SD cards and disks. Runs as a background systemd service, no internet
 access required.
